  "description": "The Dawes Venture range is built for versatility, offering a comfortable and dependable ride for city streets, countryside tracks, and everything in between. Whether you're commuting, exploring, or simply enjoying a leisurely ride, these hybrid bikes are designed to adapt to your needs with lightweight aluminium frames and rider-focused geometry. With simplicity and comfort at their core, the Venture models feature ergonomic designs, reliable components, and optional low-step frames for easy access. Perfect for riders seeking practicality and ease of use, the Venture range combines value, comfort, and versatility to suit any adventure The Dawes Venture 1.0 Low Step is a minimalist hybrid focused on delivering exceptional value and low maintenance without compromising comfort or practicality. The lightweight aluminium frame and sturdy steel fork ensure it’s ready for city rides, canal towpaths, or gravel paths. Featuring a low step frame that maximises comfort and confidence when getting on and off the bike. With a single front chainring and six reliable Shimano gears at the rear, the Venture 1.0 keeps things simple while providing plenty of range to handle a variety of terrains. With braking being taken care of by alloy V-brakes that are reliable, and easy to maintain. With ergonomic grips, swept-back handlebars, and a padded saddle, every ride is smooth and enjoyable. Frame bosses for mudguards, racks, and kickstand enhance its versatility, making the Venture 1.0 a practical and dependable choice for any journey.",
